    "detailed_description": "Let's play Desktop Baseball!<br>Master simple controls and think up complex tricks and strategies!<br><br>Desktop Baseball 2 brings ballparks with all sorts of features!<br>Observe the situation keenly and hit the ball left or right!<br><br>Customize your players and freely design your team!<br>Set your sights on making your team one of a kind!<br><br>[Practice Game]<br>Enjoy a light and fun single player match!<br>Adjust the number of innings to set up a practice match, a full game, or anything in-between!<br><br>[Friendly Game]<br>Try out 2-player mode with a friend!<br>Strategize well and victory will be within your grasp!<br><br>[Team Selection]<br>Adjust everything from your team members' names, positions, and batting order in General Settings to visual details in Style Settings and craft a team to your liking!<br>Change up uniforms, bats, pitches, and more to complete your own unique team!<br><br>[Tournament]<br>Challenge the Champion Cup with the teams you've made!<br>Hone your skills until you're ready to compete on the world stage!<br><br>[Capsule Home Run]<br>Use the points you've earned in other modes to get items like new uniforms and bats!<br>With more items come more ways to build a team unique to you!<br><br>[Mini Game]<br>Earn points in Knock Rush!<br>Win tons of points by pulling off a brilliant defense!<br><br>*Controllers are required for multiplayer play.",
